MODULE: ReaderEventuallyResolvesNeverCaptures
TARGET: ReaderEventuallyResolves
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: A delivered reader opportunity does not initiate the capture.
PERTURBS: ReaderOpportunity
--- FIND
    /\ (Capture \/ Acquire \/ ReadLeaf \/ Validate \/ ReaderIdle)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the continuation loses the capture work.
    /\ ((reader = "capture"
            /\ UNCHANGED <<reader, snapshot, observed, attempts, crossed, held, leaseLeft>>)
        \/ Acquire \/ ReadLeaf \/ Validate \/ ReaderIdle)
--- END
